Package modules citing a TradingView script whose licence is not verified
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
These files cite a TradingView script that is not in the local source corpus (or,
for halftrend and wavetrend, name only the author and title), so its licence was
not checked. lrsi, po, vwmacd, mmar: the script page returned 404 on 2026-11-28.
pmax, vfi: the page exists and is labelled open-source, but its source was not
visible to a fetch. halftrend, wavetrend: author and title only. Until checked,
treat their licence as unknown.

